        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Snufkin: Melody of Moominvalley is a musical adventure game in which Snufkin needs to restore the harmony of Moominvalley, after a series of grotesque parks has appeared and ruined the valley's natural balance. The game is an ambient and wholesome experience for both kids and adults, and combines open world-mechanics with puzzles, stealth and melodic elements.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Snufkin: Melody of Moominvalley es un juego de aventuras musicales en el que Snufkin debe restaurar la armonía del Valle de los Mumin, tras la aparición de una serie de parques grotescos que han roto el equilibrio natural del valle. Es una experiencia ambiental y amena para niños y adultos, que combina mecánicas de mundo abierto con puzles, sigilo y elementos melódicos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
